#: ../../source/docs/drift-mode.rst:5 fc5e73a8a9494d0796d6a529da090de7
msgid "Drift Mode"
msgstr "Drift 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/drift-mode.rst:7 0252dd145f6c49d0969583b04527edef
msgid ""
"This page provides tips for flying in Drift Mode and methods for tuning "
"your copter to fly optimally in Drift Mode."
msgstr "本页提供了在 Drift 模式下飞行的技巧，以及调整飞机以在 Drift 模式下达到最佳飞行状态的方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/drift-mode.rst:11 6d546c3ca3fd4a3687c62c66a59a6b3e
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/drift-mode.rst:13 032a9f202cff48a6ab64f78de68ede59
msgid ""
"Drift Mode allows the user to fly a multi-copter as if it were a plane "
"with built in automatic coordinated turns."
msgstr "Drift 模式允许用户像驾驶飞机一样驾驶多旋翼，内置自动协调转弯功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/drift-mode.rst:15 5ede97fa742f49e7ba8431f736e48e47
msgid ""
"The user has direct control of Yaw and Pitch, but Roll is controlled by "
"the autopilot.  This allows the copter to be controlled very intuitively "
"with a single control stick if using a Mode 2 transmitter"
msgstr "用户可直接控制偏航和俯仰，但横滚由飞控控制。这使得使用 Mode 2 遥控器时，用单根控制摇杆即可非常直觉地控制飞机"

#: ../../source/docs/drift-mode.rst:18 ca8af1867a60439cb295774648bf0765
msgid ""
"The user has completely manual control over the throttle as in "
":ref:`Stabilize mode <stabilize-mode>`."
msgstr "用户对油门拥有完全的手动控制权，与 :ref:`Stabilize 模式 <stabilize-mode>` 相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/drift-mode.rst:25 e771317411b94d27a5b21d9e2332f966
msgid "How Drift Mode works"
msgstr "Drift 模式的工作原理"

#: ../../source/docs/drift-mode.rst:27 ca03ada09b8145adaccc540101b2fe46
msgid ""
"You \"fly\" the MultiCopter with the right stick (on Mode 2 controllers) "
"controls Pitch and Yaw."
msgstr "您用右摇杆（Mode 2 控制器）\"驾驶\"多旋翼，控制俯仰和偏航。"

#: ../../source/docs/drift-mode.rst:29 184e91030c7149bc8444ea944608ee0d
msgid ""
"You use the left stick primarily for altitude control but not for yaw "
"directly."
msgstr "您主要使用左摇杆控制高度，而非直接控制偏航。"

#: ../../source/docs/drift-mode.rst:31 1680d291e07b48748d6dbc7c9fdc272a
msgid ""
"When you push the right stick forward or back the copter will pitch (and "
"accelerate) in the appropriate direction."
msgstr "当您将右摇杆向前或向后推时，飞机将朝相应方向俯仰（并加速）。"

#: ../../source/docs/drift-mode.rst:33 46b7e0ac853b4652b327bf5c58c1a84f
msgid ""
"When you push the right stick towards one side or the other the right or "
"to the left the copter will turn in the direction specified."
msgstr "当您将右摇杆向左或向右推时，飞机将朝指定方向转弯。"

#: ../../source/docs/drift-mode.rst:35 f0aa98804fe0454bb5ca7fd5d539b155
msgid ""
"The copter will also bank at the same time so as to make a coordinated "
"turn in that direction."
msgstr "飞机同时会进行横滚，以实现协调转弯。"

#: ../../source/docs/drift-mode.rst:37 946d14f0d5674650a588957ba3287351
msgid ""
"When turning with the right stick yaw is automatically applied and "
"sufficient roll is added to cancel the copters velocity in the roll axis."
msgstr "使用右摇杆转弯时，偏航将自动施加，并添加足够的横滚以抵消飞机在横滚轴上的速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/drift-mode.rst:40 586df2ebbf7d42b988ac50204c887bbf
msgid "This allows you to maintain a coordinated (non-skidding) turn."
msgstr "这使您能够保持协调（不侧滑）的转弯。"

#: ../../source/docs/drift-mode.rst:41 b493144ebbaa411faacd96242929a397
msgid ""
"Letting go of the sticks effectively turns on a speed brake in the Pitch "
"axis that slows the copter to a stop over a two second period."
msgstr "松开摇杆相当于在俯仰轴上启用速度制动，使飞机在约两秒内减速停止。"

#: ../../source/docs/drift-mode.rst:43 f8e82338b9f4460bad5c1e11ff54817c
msgid ""
"A copter in Drift Mode with the right stick in the center will loosely "
"hold horizontal position (It will slowly drift in the wind.)"
msgstr "右摇杆居中的 Drift 模式飞机将大致保持水平位置（但会随风缓慢漂移）。"

#: ../../source/docs/drift-mode.rst:45 c3ff5a42cc414cbfbc0c9e4f7b85e4a3
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Pilot’s throttle input controls the average motor speed meaning that "
"constant adjustment of the throttle is required to maintain altitude.  If"
" the pilot puts the throttle completely down the motors will go to their "
"minimum rate (:ref:`MOT_SPIN_MIN <MOT_SPIN_MIN>`) and if the vehicle is "
"flying it will lose attitude control and tumble."
msgstr "飞手的油门输入控制电机的平均转速，这意味着需要不断调整油门以保持高度。如果飞手将油门完全推到底，电机将降至最低转速（MOT_SPIN_ARMED），若飞机正在飞行，它将失去姿态控制并翻滚。"

#: ../../source/docs/drift-mode.rst:50 17c8608736f441b09d965638c2277137
#, fuzzy
msgid "Drift Mode relies on a valid position estimate, such as GPS, for control."
msgstr "Drift 模式依赖 GPS 进行控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/drift-mode.rst:51 e60a769e1cb1400eba8eb8d1bb006f35
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you lose your GPS signal in flight while in Drift Mode, your copter "
"will either land or enter altitude hold based on your :ref:`FS_EKF_ACTION"
" <FS_EKF_ACTION>` setting."
msgstr "如果在 Drift 模式飞行时失去 GPS 信号，飞机将根据您的 failsafe_gps_enabled 设置降落或进入定高模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/drift-mode.rst:54 cc86c88e43b4445c8b386e7c3061672c
msgid ""
"You should also be prepared to switch back to Stabilize Mode for manual "
"recovery if necessary."
msgstr "如有必要，您还应准备好切换回 Stabilize 模式进行手动恢复。"

#: ../../source/docs/drift-mode.rst:58 ea86f3ac6f824b149f8672bfdea5a3ad
#, fuzzy
msgid "What's it Useful For"
msgstr "适用场景"

#: ../../source/docs/drift-mode.rst:60 bde5096383a644ce975d56766f65bbbb
msgid ""
"FPV flyers who are looking for a dynamic, plane like flight as well as "
"loiter-like position hold."
msgstr "寻求动态、类似固定翼飞行体验以及类似 Loiter 定点悬停的 FPV 飞手。"

#: ../../source/docs/drift-mode.rst:62 d4d3cea2db194ff1859a5580b72e1711
msgid "New flyers who want to try a more intuitive and easy to learn flight mode."
msgstr "想要尝试更直觉、更易学飞行模式的新手飞手。"

#: ../../source/docs/drift-mode.rst:64 e7aa946373c1477584da1fae3eee04ca
msgid ""
"Anybody who would like to try an easy to fly and easy to learn and very "
"fun mode."
msgstr "任何想尝试这种易飞、易学且非常有趣的飞行模式的人。"

#: ../../source/docs/drift-mode.rst:66 a2a4a9149a04452ca8dc488138f7e858
msgid ""
"Photographers and especially videographers who want a smoother and more "
"coordinated filming result."
msgstr "想要获得更平滑、更协调拍摄效果的摄影师和摄像师。"

#: ../../source/docs/drift-mode.rst:70 b5ae47d23a6f4fe4ac179ab2006da864
msgid "Setting up Drift Mode"
msgstr "设置 Drift 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/drift-mode.rst:72 68184cdc4c534338b53ae19ae645acbe
msgid ""
"In the Mission Planner Configuration Section under flight modes select "
"Drift Mode to apply to an appropriate switch setting."
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 配置部分的飞行模式设置中，选择 Drift 模式并分配到适当的开关位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/drift-mode.rst:74 bd5de557f2a04aa3982f357d3da26e86
msgid ""
"More information on tuning Drift mode is expected to be forthcoming "
"shortly as are additional enhancements to Drift Mode itself."
msgstr "关于 Drift 模式调参的更多信息以及对 Drift 模式本身的进一步增强，预计即将推出。"

#~ msgid "**Drift Mode is available as of release 3.1 of the Copter firmware.**"
#~ msgstr "**Drift 模式自 Copter 固件 3.1 版本起可用。**"

